# GraphFocus — Cursor Rules

## Project: Multi-language code knowledge graph generator

## Key patterns:
- Extractor plugin pattern: inherit from LanguageExtractor in graphfocus/extractors/base.py
- Use make_id() for deterministic node IDs
- Every node needs: id, label, language, kind, source_file, source_location
- Every edge needs: source, target, relation, confidence (EXTRACTED|INFERRED|AMBIGUOUS)
- Tree-sitter for AST parsing, regex fallback for languages without grammar

## File structure:
- graphfocus/extractors/<language>_extractor.py — one per language
- graphfocus/extractors/registry.py — auto-discovers extractors
- graphfocus/detect/detector.py — file classification
- graphfocus/graph/ — NetworkX graph building + Leiden clustering
- graphfocus/api/ — FastAPI REST API
- tests/test_<language>_extractor.py — tests per language
- tests/fixtures/<language>/ — sample files per language

## Tech: Python 3.11+, tree-sitter, NetworkX, graspologic, Click, FastAPI, ruff

## Commands: make dev | make test | make lint | make serve
